# Play test of Coyote Mesa (CIPlay coyote_mesa, in a test world 'CI ...'). No quest: the hermit's cabin and box, up the
# west mesa's ladders, across the rope bridge to the east mesa's hidden chest; the hyenas, the screecher, the treasure.
# Points as in its recipe.
island Coyote Mesa
offset 0 0
expect animals Hyena 3
expect animals Screecher 1
wait 3
kill Hyena
kill Screecher
# The hermit's cabin
walk -25.75 -25 to -25.75 -23 to -25.75 -20.5 h=3.1 below=4
open Hermit's box
# Up the west mesa
at -18 -13.5 h=3
climb -18 -11.65 h=3
expect stand -18 -9.5 h=7.8 below=9
climb -18 -8.15 h=7.8
expect stand -18 -6 h=12.6 below=14
climb -18 -4.65 h=12.6
expect stand -18 0 h=17.4 below=19
# Across the bridge
walk -15 0 to -12 0 to -2 0 to 8 0 to 12 0 h=17.5 below=19
expect stand -2.7 0 h=15.9 below=17
open The hermit's hidden chest
dig
